defmodule Tuist.Marketing.Overdrive.OgImage do
  @moduledoc """
  The Open Graph card for an Overdrive project page, rendered as HTML and
  captured by `Tuist.OpenGraphImageRenderer`.

  Same frame as the docs card (1920x1080, near-black ground, Tuist wordmark
  bottom-left) with the project's name as the title, the upstream repository
  it was forked from above it, and up to three headline numbers below, so a
  shared link shows what the project looks like on Tuist at a glance.
  "Overdrive" sits bottom-right where the docs card shows its category.
  """
  use Phoenix.Component

  alias Phoenix.HTML.Safe

  attr :name, :string, required: true
  attr :upstream_handle, :string, required: true
  attr :stats, :list, required: true
  attr :font_data_uri, :string, required: true

